		"Octave and program buttons",
		"Pitch and modulation wheels"
	],
	"notice": "This is the 37-mini-key iRig Keys 2, not the full-size-key Pro or 25-key Mini. Pitch and modulation wheels and a pedal input are present. The four assignable knobs provide two banks; assignments depend on the selected setup. Match the output MIDI channel to the receiving instrument. Use the correct IK 2.5 mm MIDI adapter; ordinary 3.5 mm TRS MIDI adapters do not fit. The headphone output is audio, not a MIDI connection. Exact browser MIDI port aliases have not been verified; select this profile manually. DIN-connected hardware appears under the MIDI interface name. Physical controls are unbound and this profile does not supply a complete MIDI implementation. Diagrams show selected physical controls with illustrative positions; consult the linked manufacturer references for the full panel.",
